  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Kotido rapid needs assessment in response to famine alert in the Karamoja region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Kotido Diocese, 41,800 HHs are in dire need of food as a result of prolonged drought from July &#x2013; October 2015. Households were increasingly applying coping strategies such as; reduced number of meals per day (2 meals), reliance on firewood and charcoal burning for income, movements within and out of districts in search of food and increased sale of livestock. According to an assessment done by WFP in October 2015, 14 sub counties are at high risk.</narrative>
  </description>
